%% M5: offline completion, durable outbox, idempotent upload and LearnHouse read-back.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Learner
  participant A as App (screens)
  participant Q as SQLite outbox
  participant S as Sync engine
  participant B as BFF /api/me/events
  participant I as inbox.db
  participant LH as LearnHouse API
  Note over A,Q: Device offline
  L->>A: Complete slide / submit quiz
  A->>Q: enqueue(eventId=UUID once, deviceId, seq, schemaVersion=1, payload)
  A-->>L: Shown as done (pending overlay on saved trail)
  Note over A,LH: Process may be killed here — row survives in SQLite
  Note over S,B: Connectivity returns / app foregrounded
  S->>Q: listSendable(pending + received, max batch)
  S->>B: POST batch (same eventIds on every retry)
  B->>I: lookup eventId + payload hash
  alt new event
    B->>I: insert row (received)
    B->>LH: write (complete activity / submit attempt)
    B->>LH: read trail / grade back
    LH-->>B: state
    B->>I: mark applied (only if read-back confirms)
  else same id, same payload
    B-->>B: return stored result (no second write)
  else same id, different payload
    B-->>B: rejected: event_id_reused
  end
  B-->>S: per-event status: applied | received | rejected
  S->>Q: applied → delete · received → retry later · rejected → keep, show
